  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Shield protects web applications from large and sophisticated DDoS attacks at Layer 3, 4 and 7. In addition AWS Shield provides visibility in attacks, and access to 24X7 DDoS Response Team.",
